. ४९. १७; Br. III. १०. ७०; वा. ७३. १८; ९९. २४०; Vi. IV. २०. ३६-7.\nBy his appointment कृष्णद्वैपायन gave two sons [page३-218+ २८] धृतराष्टृअ, and पाण्डु to अम्बिका and Vidura to अम्बालिका, his queens.\n3: M. ५०. ४५-7."}]}]}],"vicetas":[{"id":"vicetas","headword":"विचेतस्","headword_slp1":"vicetas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--a Bhavya god. Br. II. ३६. ७२."}]}]}],"vici":[{"id":"vIci","headword":"वीचि","headword_slp1":"vIci","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--the name of a hell. Br. "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 2","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". १५०."}]}]}],"vicya":[{"id":"vIcya","headword":"वीच्य","headword_slp1":"vIcya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--a name of a hell. वा. १०१. १४९."}]}]}]}